<h1>Verify your PicMeS email address</h1>

<p>Verify this email address for your PicMeS account.</p>

<p>
  <a
    href="<%= @verification_url %>"
    style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 18px; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000000; text-decoration: none;"
